 "personaname": "Wizidross", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/wizidross/", "num_games_owned": 395, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 8438, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 792, "playtime_at_review": 754, "last_played": 1787880428, "avatar": "cfc13c1e2738f2a52bf2592a0be376f8304201c2"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game so fun it makes me forget that we're playing as the bad guys.", "timestamp_created": 1712620305, "timestamp_updated": 1712620305, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "162511816", "author": {"steamid": "76561198101094214", "personaname": "SynthKo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198101094214/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 95, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 95, "last_played": 1712618420, "avatar": "1c3512d320b6ec35c10f8a2238027e0d0049efd7"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've played 5 matches, none of them were even remotely interesting. They were short runs from one place to another while firing at enemies that got too close. The game decided to crash on the 6th and I had to make a decision if I want to continue playing it or not. Unfortunately, there really wasn't anything that caught my attention and I decided that those 40 euros are better spent elsewhere.\nThe game acquired a lot of hype after its release, and I understand why, but this game is clearly not for everyone, especially not for people with allergy to grind, people that need some kind of progression and continuity in the game, even if it is built around some sort of cycle. It reminded me of mass effect 3 coop, but mass effect 3 coop was very varied and the maps were hand-built. You had tons of different options for classes and weapons.\nI've really started to hate procedural generation last year, and this is a great example of  \"why\".", "timestamp_created": 1712620302, "timestamp_updated": 1712620302, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.509202480316162109", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "162511802", "author": {"steamid": "76561198142122319", "personaname": "SpeedofUncertainty", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198142122319/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 12469, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 134, "playtime_at_review": 6416, "last_played": 1788042139, "avatar": "b8747bcd765aa4fb3631c923aab8d33550f94a14"}, "language": "english", "review": "yay", "timestamp_created": 1712620285, "timestamp_updated": 1726855617, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "162511779", "author": {"steamid": "76561198095704457", "personaname": "Mac Bull", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198095704457/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 20525, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 821, "playtime_at_review": 3596, "last_played": 1787849953, "avatar": "6b685267fa26618607af4a2990518cf7553e467c"}, "language": "english", "review": "FOR SUPER EARTH!!!!", "timestamp_created": 1712620244, "timestamp_updated": 1712620244, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "com